---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---
<Base title="About">
  <header class="page-head">
    <span class="mono dim">About / Perkin Yang</span>
    <p class="serif">Chiayi to Santa Clara</p>
    <h1>{SITE.name}</h1>
  </header>
  <div class="prose">
    <!-- Write your story here. Plain HTML is fine. -->
    <p>I grew up in Chiayi, Taiwan, and I now study MIS at Santa Clara. I build with AI most days and host a podcast called Still Human.</p>
    <p>I started writing because I kept having thoughts I had no one to say them to. Two years of vibe coding taught me how fast a tool can make things, and how easy it is to ship something with no point. So I write to find the point first.</p>
    <h2>Now</h2>
    <p class="dim">Coursework, building with AI, recording Still Human, and writing more than I ship.</p>
    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>, or find me on {SITE.links.map((l, i) => <>{i > 0 && ', '}<a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a></>)}.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
